    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "#Autoplay\n\nAutoplay automatically plays the next recommended video, song, or piece of content after the current one ends, without the user having to click anything.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4e6dc970e1b1641f3a38a003617b60d0-Screenshot 2025-10-16 at 12.48.27 PM.png",
        "key": "computer-systems-lesson3-onlineresources-1-5c25ddab-c99a-4b94-8628-1e8d9bc30c38",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "#Jordan\n_Animation Designer_\n\n> Autoplay keeps the inspiration coming—I can watch new animation styles and techniques without pausing to search. It helps me stay in the creative zone while I design.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/18a4a5f66d1151528b91bc794df4c95d-Screenshot 2025-10-16 at 12.57.52 PM.png",
        "key": "undefined-91f68b3a-8101-4f9c-861a-555ac85b7c47"
      },
      {
        "text": "#Eileen\n_Journalist_\n\n>I often review multiple videos for my reporting, and autoplay makes it easy to lose track of sources. It’s important for my credibility to know exactly where each clip came from.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/790744e48cadcb9113c120c9ba6f370d-Screenshot 2025-10-16 at 12.55.51 PM.png",
        "key": "ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-lesson1-level3c-test-2025-ae8e8691-dca1-493a-a5b1-c96222390c83",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      }
    ],
